{"seq":2,"slug":"grafting-techniques","title":"大学园艺学 — 嫁接技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/grafting-techniques","wordCount":2095,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学园艺学-嫁接技术\">大学园艺学 — 嫁接技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>嫁接是将一个植物体的芽或枝（接穗 scion）连接到另一个植物体（砧木 rootstock）上，使二者形成维管束连接并作为一个有机整体继续生长的营养繁殖技术。嫁接的历史可追溯至公元前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 年的中国和地中海地区，至今仍是果树、蔬菜和观赏植物生产中不可替代的核心技术。</p>\n<p>嫁接的应用价值多维：利用砧木的抗逆性（抗寒、抗旱、抗土传病害）改善接穗品种的适应性，利用矮化砧木控制树体大小，利用中间砧解决品种间不亲和问题。全球约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 的苹果商品果园使用嫁接苗，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上的设施蔬菜（西瓜、番茄、黄瓜）在主产区采用嫁接栽培以克服连作障碍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"嫁接的生物学基础\">嫁接的生物学基础</h3><p>嫁接成活的本质是砧木和接穗在切口处形成新的维管束连接。这一过程可分为三个阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段——愈伤组织形成</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\text{-}7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 天）：切口处的薄壁细胞受创伤刺激后开始活跃分裂，形成愈伤组织（callus）。该过程受生长素和细胞分裂素调控，温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{-}30°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为最适范围。低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时愈伤组织形成显著减缓。</p>\n<p><strong>第二阶段——形成层连接</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天）：砧木与接穗的愈伤组织相互嵌合，其中部分细胞分化为新的形成层细胞带，将两者的形成层桥接起来。形成层对接的精度是嫁接成功的关键——砧穗形成层对齐面积越大，愈合速度越快。</p>\n<p><strong>第三阶段——维管束分化</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\text{-}28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 天）：新形成的形成层向外分化出韧皮部，向内分化出木质部，最终建立完整的水分和养分输导通路。此时嫁接苗可以逐步撤除保湿保温措施。</p>\n<p>嫁接亲和性（Graft Compatibility）是嫁接成功的前提。一般规律：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>亲缘关系</th>\n<th>亲和性</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同品种/同种</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>苹果品种间互嫁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同属异种</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>梨/杜梨、桃/毛桃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同科异属</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>番茄/茄子、西瓜/南瓜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异科</td>\n<td>极低或不亲和</td>\n<td>通常无法成活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>嫁接不亲和的机制包括：维管组织连接不完整（组织学不亲和）、分泌有毒物质（生化不亲和）、生长速率差异过大（发育不亲和）。梨/榅桲是经典的延迟不亲和案例——嫁接初期生长正常，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年后接合部产生棕色坏死层，需插入亲和的中间砧解决。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主要嫁接方法\">主要嫁接方法</h3><p><strong>枝接法</strong>——在休眠期或萌芽初期进行，使用一年生休眠枝条作接穗：</p>\n<p><strong>切接</strong>：最常用的枝接方法。砧木从距地面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}10\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 处截断，沿一侧纵切 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>；接穗保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个芽，下端削成长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的长斜面和对侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>0.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\text{-}0.8\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的短斜面，插入砧木切口使一侧形成层对齐，用嫁接膜紧密绑缚。成活率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%\\text{-}95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>劈接</strong>：适合砧木较粗（直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;3\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）的情况。砧木截断后从中央纵劈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}5\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，接穗下端削成楔形（两面等长斜面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}4\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>），插入劈口两侧各一穗。粗砧劈接常用于老树高接换种。</p>\n<p><strong>腹接</strong>：不截断砧木主干，在砧木侧面斜切一刀（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span> 角，深达木质部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>），将削好的接穗插入。适合补接和多品种嫁接。</p>\n<p><strong>芽接法</strong>——取接穗上的单个芽片嫁接，用芽量少，操作快速：</p>\n<p><strong>T 形芽接</strong>：砧木树皮上切&quot;T&quot;形口（横切 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，纵切 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>），接穗上取盾形芽片（长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}2.5\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8\\text{-}1\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，带或不带木质部），插入&quot;T&quot;口翻起的皮层下，绑缚时露出芽眼。夏秋季砧木离皮期进行，嫁接速度可达每人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\text{-}500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 株/天。</p>\n<p><strong>嵌芽接</strong>：在砧木上切取一块与芽片等大的皮层去除，将芽片嵌入贴合，绑缚固定。不受离皮期限制，适用季节更广。</p>\n<h3 id=\"蔬菜嫁接技术\">蔬菜嫁接技术</h3><p>蔬菜嫁接是克服设施栽培连作障碍的有效手段。主要组合和方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接穗</th>\n<th>砧木</th>\n<th>嫁接目的</th>\n<th>常用方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>西瓜</td>\n<td>南瓜（葫芦科）</td>\n<td>抗枯萎病</td>\n<td>插接法、靠接法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄瓜</td>\n<td>黑籽南瓜</td>\n<td>抗低温、耐盐</td>\n<td>靠接法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>番茄</td>\n<td>茄子/野生番茄</td>\n<td>抗青枯病、线虫</td>\n<td>套管嫁接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>茄子</td>\n<td>托鲁巴姆</td>\n<td>抗黄萎病</td>\n<td>劈接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>插接法</strong>（蔬菜特有）：南瓜砧木在子叶展开时去除生长点，用竹签从砧木断面斜向下插入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>0.7</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\text{-}0.7\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 深的孔穴；西瓜接穗削成楔形插入孔穴中。操作快速，但需要嫁接后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 天在弱光（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>lx</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000\\text{-}8000\\,\\text{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、高湿（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> RH）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\text{-}28°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">28°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的愈合环境中管理。</p>\n<p><strong>嫁接苗管理</strong>的关键参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>愈合期：遮光 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%\\text{-}80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天后逐步增光</li>\n<li>温度：白天 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>28</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\text{-}28°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">28°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，夜间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>22</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18\\text{-}22°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">22°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>湿度：前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>，之后逐步降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 天后检查成活率，去除砧木萌蘖</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"砧木选择原则\">砧木选择原则</h3><p>砧木对接穗的影响深远且多维：</p>\n<p><strong>树体大小</strong>：苹果砧木按矮化程度分为极矮化（M<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>27</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_{27}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">27</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，树高仅为实生砧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%\\text{-}30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>）、矮化（M<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%\\text{-}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>）、半矮化（M<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>26</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_{26}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">26</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%\\text{-}60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>）和乔化（实生砧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>）。现代密植果园（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 株/公顷）普遍采用 M<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 系矮化砧，配合支架系统，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 年即可投产。</p>\n<p><strong>抗逆性</strong>：葡萄嫁接最初是为抗根瘤蚜——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span></span> 世纪欧洲葡萄产业因根瘤蚜几近毁灭，后来发现美洲种葡萄砧木（如 SO4、5BB、3309C）具有天然抗性，嫁接成为欧洲葡萄栽培的标准做法。</p>\n<p><strong>对果实品质的影响</strong>：砧木通过调控根系对矿质元素的吸收间接影响果实品质。柑橘嫁接在枳壳砧木上果实酸度增加、风味浓郁；嫁接在柚砧上果实偏大但风味淡。果农在选择砧木时需要在产量、果实品质和树体管理之间权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个苹果矮化密植果园的建园方案：选择砧穗组合，确定栽植密度和树形，说明选择矮化砧木的理由和管理要点。</li>\n<li>西瓜嫁接到南瓜砧木后，部分消费者反映果实口味变淡。从砧穗互作的生理学角度分析可能原因，并提出改进建议。</li>\n<li>在春季进行桃树切接操作：详细描述从砧木处理、接穗削切、插入对齐到绑缚包扎的全过程，指出每个步骤中最容易出错的关键点。</li>\n<li>梨树嫁接在榅桲砧木上出现延迟不亲和现象，提出两种可能的解决方案并分析各自优缺点。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解<strong>嫁接机器人</strong>在蔬菜工厂化育苗中的应用进展和技术瓶颈</li>\n<li>研究嫁接接合部的<strong>表观遗传变化</strong>（DNA 甲基化、小 RNA 信号）及其对接穗表型的影响</li>\n<li>探索<strong>异科远缘嫁接</strong>的最新研究突破和争议</li>\n<li>关注<strong>砧木基因组学</strong>在定向选育多抗砧木品种中的应用前景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>嫁接技术将不同植物个体的优势特性组合在一起，是园艺学中独特且不可替代的繁殖手段。从愈伤组织形成到维管束贯通的生物学过程，从枝接到芽接的操作技术，从砧木矮化效应到蔬菜抗病嫁接的产业实践，嫁接的每一个环节都体现了对植物发育生物学的深刻理解和精湛的操作技艺。掌握嫁接的原理与实操方法，是园艺专业从业者的核心能力之一。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学园艺学 — 嫁接技术","id":"大学园艺学-嫁接技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"嫁接的生物学基础","id":"嫁接的生物学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"主要嫁接方法","id":"主要嫁接方法"},{"level":3,"text":"蔬菜嫁接技术","id":"蔬菜嫁接技术"},{"level":3,"text":"砧木选择原则","id":"砧木选择原则"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 组织培养","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/tissue-culture"},"next":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 精准农业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/precision-agriculture"}}